     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<i>The Analects of Confucius</i> are a set of writings that outline an aspect of Confucius’s character, his life, his exile, and his wise sayings. They also include his conversations with his followers. These are his ideas on life and his teachings, which strongly emphasize the importance of morality for the betterment of oneself and society in general. Some of these topics include showing respect for your parents, living a life of integrity, and the value of hard work. In other words, they are a roadmap for us to live by."
    }
